  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Given an opponent whose estimated range is {KhKd, 8h7h, AhKh, 9h9d, 6h5h, Th9h, QhJh, Ac2c} on flop Ks 8d 7c and hero first to act, When the range that would call a bet is derived, Then it is the 6 combos {KhKd, 8h7h, AhKh, 9h9d, 6h5h, Th9h} [REQ-033.2, REQ-033.6]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Given that decision with hero holding 8s8c, When advice is requested, Then equity against the calling range is 72.8% and advice recommends bet with the value-bet rule id [REQ-033.2]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Given that decision with hero holding AsKc, When advice is requested, Then equity against the calling range is 48.9% (60.7% against the whole range) and advice does not recommend a value bet [REQ-033.2]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Given a postflop decision with no bet faced, When equity against the range that would call a bet is 50.1%, Then advice recommends bet with the value-bet rule id [REQ-033.2]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Given the same decision, When equity against the range that would call is exactly 50.0%, Then advice does not recommend a value bet [REQ-033.2]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Given a postflop decision facing a bet on a street that is not capped, When equity against the range that would call a raise is 50.1%, Then advice recommends raise [REQ-033.2]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Given the same holding on a capped street, When advice is requested, Then it recommends call or fold by the pot-odds rule [REQ-033.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Given a value-bet or value-raise recommendation, When it is returned, Then it includes equity against the calling range %, required equity % and the rule id [REQ-033.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Given a value-bet spot, When recommendPostflop returns, Then the recommendation includes equityVsCallingRangePct and bet/raise outcomes alongside the existing fields, without breaking existing consumers",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Given postflop free-check decisions depend on equity for value bets, When this story lands, Then the TAG bot's FREE_CHECK_EQUITY stand-in is removed or limited to spots where equity cannot change the move, with the playtest still under its time limits",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Given a real postflop recommendation now carries equityVsCallingRangePct, When a user bets or raises against advice to check or call, Then gradeView grades it by aggression-margin and aggression-no-range no longer fires for real recommendations",
      "checked": false
    }
  ],
